WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.097 --> 00:00:01.745
- I feel like at this point
with these taste tests,

00:00:01.745 --> 00:00:03.556
every time someone tells
me ti's a mystery meat,

00:00:03.556 --> 00:00:05.254
I'm expecting like balls.

00:00:06.361 --> 00:00:09.306
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:09.306 --> 00:00:11.581
- It's possible I've never
had Haitian food before.

00:00:11.581 --> 00:00:14.065
- I don't really know what
it's going to taste like.

00:00:14.065 --> 00:00:15.366
Maybe tropical?

00:00:15.366 --> 00:00:17.223
Caribbean? (laughs)

00:00:17.223 --> 00:00:22.185
- I am a Haitian virgin, right? (laughs)

00:00:22.185 --> 00:00:26.445
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:27.639
- Look how cute this is.

00:00:27.639 --> 00:00:28.777
- Oh my god.

00:00:28.777 --> 00:00:29.822
- That's really good.

00:00:29.822 --> 00:00:31.679
- Sign me up, gimme all of that.

00:00:31.679 --> 00:00:32.561
Yes.

00:00:32.561 --> 00:00:33.774
- Greasy.
- [Man] It's very smoky.

00:00:33.774 --> 00:00:35.180
- It's awesome.
- [Woman in blue] With like

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.327
some spiced meat goin' on, but not spicy.

00:00:37.327 --> 00:00:39.082
It's just great, it's flavorful.

00:00:39.082 --> 00:00:40.206
- That's a money shot right there.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.323
- How could you not like this?

00:00:41.323 --> 00:00:42.740
It's just puff pastry and meat.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:46.766
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:46.766 --> 00:00:49.037
- That is not what I
expected from goat meat.

00:00:49.037 --> 00:00:51.424
- I feel like I can
taste what it last ate.

00:00:51.424 --> 00:00:52.638
I'm not okay with that.

00:00:52.638 --> 00:00:53.813
- If you have goat cheese with it,

00:00:53.813 --> 00:00:54.917
is that like sick and wrong?

00:00:54.917 --> 00:00:56.700
- This is tender.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.954
And it is flavorful.

00:00:57.954 --> 00:00:59.510
- Goat is my new favorite meat.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:03.225
(upbeat music)

00:01:03.225 --> 00:01:04.827
- It's juicy.

00:01:04.827 --> 00:01:06.359
Is it fried?

00:01:06.359 --> 00:01:08.607
- Anything fried is great.

00:01:08.607 --> 00:01:09.721
- Look how tender this is.

00:01:09.721 --> 00:01:10.859
It's so tender.

00:01:10.859 --> 00:01:12.693
- I could eat this every
day and just be like fine.

00:01:12.693 --> 00:01:14.992
- I'm sorry, Mom, but I wish
you could cook like this.

00:01:14.992 --> 00:01:16.269
(laughs) I really do.

00:01:16.269 --> 00:01:21.159
(upbeat music)

00:01:21.159 --> 00:01:23.463
- Oh, that smells so good!

00:01:23.463 --> 00:01:24.856
- And it's not really fishy.

00:01:24.856 --> 00:01:26.829
- Yeah, like it's not
too chewy either though.

00:01:26.829 --> 00:01:28.733
- Very well seasoned, very well spiced.

00:01:28.733 --> 00:01:29.662
I'm a big fan.

00:01:29.662 --> 00:01:31.264
- Couldn't taste the conch though.

00:01:31.264 --> 00:01:32.750
Just ate the whole thing at once.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:36.474
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:01:36.474 --> 00:01:38.820
- There's the spine!

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:41.861
(whines) Oh my god.

00:01:41.861 --> 00:01:44.113
- This is how a fish should
be prepared, you know.

00:01:44.113 --> 00:01:46.017
We shouldn't like take all
of the (beep) out of it.

00:01:46.017 --> 00:01:49.547
- I mean the bones are like
easy enough to pick out,

00:01:49.547 --> 00:01:50.708
if a little inconvenient.

00:01:50.708 --> 00:01:51.912
- You get stabbed with a bone once,

00:01:51.912 --> 00:01:53.625
you don't get stabbed with a bone twice.

00:01:53.625 --> 00:01:54.624
- I'm a carnivore.

00:01:54.624 --> 00:01:56.500
I feel like a (beep) predator.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.102
- Oh, ugh.

00:01:58.102 --> 00:02:00.656
I thought there was no bones,
and there was one in there.

00:02:00.656 --> 00:02:02.491
- There's not a whole lot done to the fish

00:02:02.491 --> 00:02:03.821
in terms of seasoning.

00:02:03.821 --> 00:02:04.617
It's good.

00:02:04.617 --> 00:02:05.867
- (kissing smacks) Thank you.

00:02:05.867 --> 00:02:06.796
- Thank you for that.

00:02:06.796 --> 00:02:10.849
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:02:10.849 --> 00:02:12.266
- So many flavors.

00:02:12.266 --> 00:02:14.890
- It's like it's banana
bread but covered in sugar.

00:02:14.890 --> 00:02:16.468
- I don't like the word moist, but like,

00:02:16.468 --> 00:02:18.140
this is like a good moist.
- [Girl in Vest] It's moist.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:20.757
You can hear the--
(chewing smacks)

00:02:20.757 --> 00:02:22.114
- I got the clean plate award though.

00:02:23.132 --> 00:02:23.848
Mmhmm.

00:02:23.848 --> 00:02:26.717
(upbeat music)

00:02:26.717 --> 00:02:27.600
- I like Haitian food.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.044
- I didn't know that there's
this amazing, delicious

00:02:30.044 --> 00:02:31.788
flavor profile just waiting for me.

00:02:31.788 --> 00:02:33.576
- It's very rare that you
go through a taste test,

00:02:33.576 --> 00:02:35.503
and you think everything
is awesome, but seriously.

00:02:35.503 --> 00:02:36.775
- [Together] Everything is awesome!

00:02:36.775 --> 00:02:38.403
- It was so good!
- [Girl in blue] It was great!

00:02:38.403 --> 00:02:40.003
- Take me to Haiti now!
- [Girl in hat] Yes.

00:02:40.003 --> 00:02:41.647
- This is amazing!

00:02:41.647 --> 00:02:43.389
I want all of it.
- [Girl in hat] I do too.

00:02:43.389 --> 00:02:44.591
- Because it's what everybody loves.

00:02:44.591 --> 00:02:45.678
- Now it's time to take a nap.

00:02:45.678 --> 00:02:46.848
(claps) Woo!

00:02:46.848 --> 00:02:49.693
- I have a huge mouth
and very low standards

00:02:49.693 --> 00:02:52.010
in terms of how I look on camera. (laughs)

